 "1055531599147625", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974713_1055531602480958_3299547534509325263_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=n75n8Wi5qcYQ7kNvwHVgl-O&_nc_oc=AdpnW-Pvr-6Fcb9WjTRNZXNz12WTkn1VYXreZbmPQjAEnux8v4Mwqy_r8SUCOmyH5BM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af2fsTZVmASJ8f6iAow1Y_U9pBOrTiidbSHj-KHqeytKsg&oe=69EF561E"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot3.png", "id": "683511393314653", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036684_683511396647986_3047485570719539906_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=t9I66G_NgaYQ7kNvwFKzMRj&_nc_oc=Adp2xrmgtPWN3V7XAJyMyDqxS1zCGw5b76HUWGV3DTh51O7n1AkbvzTa0gLw2gRpzss&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af01mdlg5N73YU4iziSyMkA0Uh8l_SmwQBOHqmo_une4Aw&oe=69EF73C1"}, {"file_name": "HORIZONTAL_COMP_3 (0-00-33-54).png", "id": "1458793048299052", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035383_1458793051632385_6201125288883864638_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TMImEOSaU7EQ7kNvwFhwaLv&_nc_oc=AdpClGOeGojn2WOXo2emjejly7GhzSMxwLGIMlhtrYD6sOkvw8nHX8BDJfA8jz-FoiI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af3yHqNwXJJhtUp_-z6z8vHFKo1twKo33iF_OJUr-KQO4w&oe=69EF507E"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot4.png", "id": "827134765720718", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982592_827134769054051_8012892633401113797_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=z9stsE3BQYAQ7kNvwGj2sgT&_nc_oc=AdoDEFhbNFVxJIw4RcmaiM9Pfw4Tr6EW7lkwbrY9k0B4egZKkcsVRCOFrvq1ZvNXq2Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af1DPk0CmLi6w9FxoYwCPXHJHSfXx_kK0WqKtwn5RK8maQ&oe=69EF54A3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "SaberCity_Trailer_Thumbnail_1.png", "id": "117461424774283", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75639796_117461428107616_4506053201965282111_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Q43I5wwfcmoQ7kNvwHwyhxp&_nc_oc=AdqiiW4rUQKmi-jOggOO-G9id5iOkfpec5YXFGtnn9WxvCi6mmOvj3zQO1NLXVhwaZo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af0tqpidblGeB12wHtbRY0lncbjCHhS8RfEJh95PPZLHug&oe=69EF5ABB"}, "display_name": "Saber City", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Saber City is a 2-player co-located dueling game for Meta Quest. 2 players can link their headsets in the same physical space and battle with melee and ranged weapons. Saber City features mixed reality gameplay, so you and a friend can see each other in the real world ,via the Oculus Quest\u2019s cameras, and battle in AR.\n\n***NOTE:  Saber City is a multiplayer game and requires 2 Meta Quest headsets to play.\n\nIMPORTANT: Please maintain at least 3 feet distance between yourself and the other player. Be aware of your surroundings. Do not run with the headset on.\n\nYou can choose from 4 different character battle kits with unique weapons to wield in mixed reality. The current version of Saber City includes support for Meta Quest Pro and Quest 3.\n\nBattle Kits:\n\nCOWBORG - Cyber cowboy with cattle prod and shotgun\n\nSKYLORD - Hammer wielding warrior from beyond\n\nSKULL CZAR - Possessing dark energy sword and magic bow\n\nSABER SENTINAL - AR soldier with saber and pistol\n\nFor questions and feedback please join the Saber City Discord server: https://discord.gg/EhuQSbNeYV\n\nor contact via email: contact@yarwad.com\n\n", "short_description": "Saber City is a 2 player shared-space dueling game where players battle for supremacy in mixed-reality"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.yarwad.com/sabercityprivacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Yarwad Publishing Empire", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.yarwad.com/sabercity", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "con